+"""Audit the V615 Markdown and YAML task contracts without changing them.
+
+The audit is advisory. It compares two independently parsed sources and
+preserves each observed difference. A missing source produces a blocked
+artifact because absence cannot support a scientific contract conclusion.
+"""
+
